<title>SINGAPORE: CM Telecom six month net profit up 5 pct.</title>
<headline>CM Telecom six month net profit up 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of HK dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   43.66    vs     41.55</p>
<p>    Group shares (cts)	 18.00    vs     17.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		    378.78    vs    291.31</p>
<p>    Other income		 15.80    vs     13.93</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 11.02    vs	4.84</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     48.52    vs     47.23</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.15    vs	2.74</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (5.54)   vs     (3.17)</p>
<p>Note - CM Telecom International Ltd said it expected growth in its local and roaming paging subscriber base would continue to contribute to the group's profit.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
